  "question": {
    "text": "If $z=x+i y, z^{1 / 3}=a-i b,$ then $\\frac{x}{a}-\\frac{y}{b}=k\\left(a^{2}-b^{2}\\right)$\r\n\r\nwhere $k$ is equal to",
